- The “report noisy max” mechanism (add noise to each score and return the argmax) is known to be ε-DP if one adds independent Laplace noise with scale 2Δ/ε to each score (Dwork & Roth, 2014, Thm. 3.6). With Δ = 1, the required scale is 2/ε. Your mechanism uses Laplace noise with scale 1/ε, i.e., a factor 2 too small.

